title: The Ring Closes
subtitle: Late April. Von Oven's army surrounds Munich.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_bavaria = 1 and crisis_time >= 3 and e19_bav_ring = 0 and e19_bav_whites > 7
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_bav_ring = 1;
Q.e19_bav_whites -= 7;
Q.e19_bav_food -= 7;
if (Q.e19_bav_food < 0) { Q.e19_bav_food = 0; Q.e19_bav_hungry = 1; Q.e19_bav_army = Math.max(1, Q.e19_bav_army - 4); }
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Von Oven\'s army: ' + Q.e19_bav_whites + ' days from Munich';
Q.crisis_line_2 = Q.e19_bav_food > 0 ? 'Food in Munich: ' + Q.e19_bav_food + ' days' : 'Food in Munich: none';
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Red Army: ' + Q.e19_bav_army + ',000 men';
!}

= The Ring Closes

Von Oven's divisions have taken Augsburg and are closing on Munich from three sides. [? if e19_bav_hungry = 1 : On 27 April the factory councils, hungry and frightened, vote no confidence in the Executive. ?][? if e19_bav_hungry = 0 : The city is short of coal and money, but the factories still stand by the councils. ?]

In the cellars of the Luitpold Gymnasium, Red Army men guard hostages: aristocrats and members of the Thule Society, a club of anti-Semitic plotters. The Whites are shooting the Red prisoners they take. Some of our men want revenge.

- @fight: Fight for every street.
- @handover: Hand over to a council committee that will negotiate.
- @hostages: Free the hostages, and get the leaders out.

@fight
subtitle: Nobody gives clear orders about the hostages.
on-arrival: bav_hostages = 1; lean_offensive += 2; militancy += 4

Egelhofer puts every armed worker into the line.

@handover
subtitle: The fighters will call it surrender. Whether the generals accept depends on how much Bamberg fears a bloodbath.
on-arrival: {!
Q.bav_talks += 1;
Q.bav_negotiated = (Q.bav_talks >= 2 || Q.e19_bav_army >= 15) ? 1 : 0;
Q.bav_hostages = Q.bav_negotiated ? 0 : 1;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 6;
!}

[? if bav_power = 1 : Leviné and the Executive resign. ?] A new committee under Toller asks von Oven for terms. [? if bav_negotiated = 1 : Bamberg does not want a massacre in its own capital, and the generals are told to accept. ?][? if bav_negotiated = 0 : The generals answer that they do not negotiate with rebels. ?]

@hostages
subtitle: No crime the Whites can use. False passports for Leviné and the commanders.
on-arrival: bav_hostages = 0; levine_escape = 1; lean_luxemburgist += 2

The hostages are let out at night through a side door. [? if bav_power = 1 : Leviné takes his passport and refuses to use it until the end. ?]
